{"id":"e9431b6b9d55e1b2","group":"56","path":"56/56-df-modular-property.md","title":"固定符号宇宙中的模块性质","display":"df-modular-property — 固定符号宇宙中的模块性质","type":"definition","metadata":{"type":"definition","book":"Term Rewriting Systems (Terese, 2003)","book_abbrev":"56","label":"56-df-modular-property","aliases":["56-df-modular-property"],"display":"df-modular-property — 固定符号宇宙中的模块性质","depends_on":["[[56-df-disjoint-union]]"],"source_section":"§5.7.1 Definition 5.7.2","source_printed_pages":"164","source_ocr_blocks":[185],"source_verification":"statement-compared; proof-scope-in-Remark"},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"definition"},{"key":"book","html":"Term Rewriting Systems (Terese, 2003)"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"56"},{"key":"label","html":"56-df-modular-property"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>56-df-modular-property</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"df-modular-property — 固定符号宇宙中的模块性质"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"73130ab4ebcdfb39\" href=\"?note=73130ab4ebcdfb39\" title=\"56-df-disjoint-union\">56-df-disjoint-union</a></span></div>"},{"key":"source_section","html":"§5.7.1 Definition 5.7.2"},{"key":"source_printed_pages","html":"164"},{"key":"source_ocr_blocks","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>185</span></div>"},{"key":"source_verification","html":"statement-compared; proof-scope-in-Remark"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"U\\ne\\varnothing\">\\(U\\ne\\varnothing\\)</span> 是函数符号集合，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"a:U\\to\\mathbb N\">\\(a:U\\to\\mathbb N\\)</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"V\">\\(V\\)</span> 是与 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"U\">\\(U\\)</span> 不交的可数无限变量集。<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"P\">\\(P\\)</span> 为集合参数；<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{Rule}\">\\(\\operatorname{Rule}\\)</span>、<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{Sum}\">\\(\\operatorname{Sum}\\)</span> 沿用 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"73130ab4ebcdfb39\" href=\"?note=73130ab4ebcdfb39\" title=\"56-df-disjoint-union\">56-df-disjoint-union</a>。<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"a\\upharpoonright F\">\\(a\\upharpoonright F\\)</span> 表示通常函数限制。</p>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathcal S(U,a,V)\\coloneqq\\{((F,a\\upharpoonright F),R)\\mid\\varnothing\\ne F\\subseteq U\\land R\\subseteq\\operatorname{Rule}((F,a\\upharpoonright F),V)\\}.\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathcal S(U,a,V)\\coloneqq\\{((F,a\\upharpoonright F),R)\\mid\\varnothing\\ne F\\subseteq U\\land R\\subseteq\\operatorname{Rule}((F,a\\upharpoonright F),V)\\}.\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\begin{aligned}\\operatorname{Modular}(U,a,V,P)\\iff{}&amp;P\\subseteq\\mathcal S(U,a,V)\\land\\\\\n&amp;\\forall ((F_0,a_0),R_0),((F_1,a_1),R_1)\\in\\mathcal S(U,a,V)\\\\\n&amp;\\quad\\bigl(F_0\\cap F_1=\\varnothing\\Rightarrow(\\operatorname{Sum}(((F_0,a_0),R_0),((F_1,a_1),R_1))\\in P\\\\\n&amp;\\hspace{43mm}\\Longleftrightarrow (((F_0,a_0),R_0)\\in P\\land((F_1,a_1),R_1)\\in P))\\bigr).\n\\end{aligned}\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\begin{aligned}\\operatorname{Modular}(U,a,V,P)\\iff{}&amp;P\\subseteq\\mathcal S(U,a,V)\\land\\\\\n&amp;\\forall ((F_0,a_0),R_0),((F_1,a_1),R_1)\\in\\mathcal S(U,a,V)\\\\\n&amp;\\quad\\bigl(F_0\\cap F_1=\\varnothing\\Rightarrow(\\operatorname{Sum}(((F_0,a_0),R_0),((F_1,a_1),R_1))\\in P\\\\\n&amp;\\hspace{43mm}\\Longleftrightarrow (((F_0,a_0),R_0)\\in P\\land((F_1,a_1),R_1)\\in P))\\bigr).\n\\end{aligned}\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<p>原书的性质 P 是元语言中的任意 TRS 性质。此处先固定集合 U 与元数函数，再把满足性质的系统编码为系统集合的子集，避免把所有集合大小签名组成的真类当作集合量化。S 是集合：F 遍历 P(U)，每个规则集遍历相应规则集合的幂集。该相对化保留每一对具体系统的模块性问题，不声称给出了全宇宙对象语言的性质集合。</p>\n<p>来源为用户提供的 Terese (2003) 本地 DjVu，当前文字层已重新解码并核对一致。OCR 页块序号不等于 DjVu 物理页码；未取得 PDF 页码。</p>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"56-df-disjoint-union","status":"resolved","id":"73130ab4ebcdfb39","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[56-df-disjoint-union]]","embed":false},{"target":"56-df-disjoint-union","status":"resolved","id":"73130ab4ebcdfb39","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$U\\ne\\varnothing$ 是函数符号集合，$a:U\\to\\mathbb N$，$V$ 是与 $U$ 不交的可数无限变量集。$P$ 为集合参数；$\\operatorname{Rule}$、$\\operatorname{Sum}$ 沿用 [[56-df-disjoint-union]]。$a\\upharpoonright F$ 表示通常函数限制。","embed":false}],"attachments":[],"math":[{"tex":"U\\ne\\varnothing","display":false},{"tex":"a:U\\to\\mathbb N","display":false},{"tex":"V","display":false},{"tex":"U","display":false},{"tex":"P","display":false},{"tex":"\\operatorname{Rule}","display":false},{"tex":"\\operatorname{Sum}","display":false},{"tex":"a\\upharpoonright F","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathcal S(U,a,V)\\coloneqq\\{((F,a\\upharpoonright F),R)\\mid\\varnothing\\ne F\\subseteq U\\land R\\subseteq\\operatorname{Rule}((F,a\\upharpoonright F),V)\\}.","display":true},{"tex":"\\begin{aligned}\\operatorname{Modular}(U,a,V,P)\\iff{}&P\\subseteq\\mathcal S(U,a,V)\\land\\\\\n&\\forall ((F_0,a_0),R_0),((F_1,a_1),R_1)\\in\\mathcal S(U,a,V)\\\\\n&\\quad\\bigl(F_0\\cap F_1=\\varnothing\\Rightarrow(\\operatorname{Sum}(((F_0,a_0),R_0),((F_1,a_1),R_1))\\in P\\\\\n&\\hspace{43mm}\\Longleftrightarrow (((F_0,a_0),R_0)\\in P\\land((F_1,a_1),R_1)\\in P))\\bigr).\n\\end{aligned}","display":true}],"bytes":1924,"backlinks":[{"id":"7a89e84aacc9537c","anchor":"ref-336","locations":["正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"[[56-df-modular-property.md]]"}],"outgoing":["73130ab4ebcdfb39"]}